     "a rolling baseline of twelve packet rates, a persistence counter and a background thread that samples CPU, memory and network counters every five seconds. "
     "The pipeline modules sit underneath: `monitoring/` captures or simulates packets and aggregates them into the ten-feature schema, `ml/` holds the schema, the training "
